title: "Selection Symmetry as an Operational Diagnostic for Correlations under Data Filtering"
abstract: "A reproducible and interdisciplinary framework for diagnosing when a correlation is invariant under data selection and when it can be explained as information introduced by the filtering mechanism itself."
